window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The fate of the cosmos lies in her hands.</p> <p>Hades has unleashed chaos across the System of Universes, and Earth teeters on the brink of devastation. The Great War has begun, and the forces of darkness will stop at nothing to destroy everything the Founder has sought to protect. Humanity faces a terrifying purge, with survival hanging by a thread.</p> <p>Isabel’s mission is clear: activate the bridges and restore balance, even if it means risking everything—including her love for Alex. As the prophecy unfolds, the arrival of the Angel Heir brings hope, but the battle has only just begun.</p> <p>Ancient rivalries reignite as Hera and Persephone must unite to save Gaia from annihilation. Meanwhile, Angel William uncovers a shocking truth that will forever reshape his bond with Isabel and Alex.</p> <p>Get your copy today and experience the thrilling conclusion to the epic saga that has captured hearts around the world!</p>"; 
